1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,040
[Built in Love]

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,530
Hello, I'm Pimji,
[Pimji Pimjira as Soul]

3
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:07,820
and I play the role of "Soul."

4
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:09,620
Hello, I'm Pineare,
[Pineare Pannin as Xinxin]

5
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,470
and I play the role of "Xinxin."

6
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:12,810
Hi, I'm Jara,
[Jara Jennifer as Lada]

7
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:14,080
and I play the role of "Lada."

8
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:15,960
Hi,
[Jennie Naruemon as Mim]

9
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,830
I'm Jennie, Naruemon Khampan,

10
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,070
and I play the role of "Mim."

11
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:25,460
[Plot summary of Built in Love]

12
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:27,870
This is a story about

13
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,500
an architect and a feng shui master

14
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:32,160
who meet on a certain project.

15
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,410
Actually, these two

16
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,940
professions don't really get along,

17
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,550
and that's what the story is about.

18
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:39,470
Xinxin and Soul got the opportunity

19
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:41,770
to work together

20
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:44,660
because it's the project that the owner wants

21
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,010
both a house design

22
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:47,890
and a feng shui consultation for,

23
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:48,910
so that's how they met.

24
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,870
It's a feng shui master and an architect

25
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:52,550
who often...

26
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:53,726
have some banter. Like,

27
00:00:53,751 --> 00:00:56,310
the feng shui master focuses on feng shui,

28
00:00:56,330 --> 00:00:58,980
while the architect is concerned
about the house design,

29
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,130
like structural stability,

30
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:01,670
natural light, and ventilation.

31
00:01:01,690 --> 00:01:03,230
And they haven't...

32
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:05,560
they haven't been
getting along from the start.

33
00:01:05,690 --> 00:01:08,130
For me, I'm like a supporting character,

34
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:09,900
like a coordinator

35
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,370
who wants

36
00:01:11,390 --> 00:01:14,060
these two to work together because

37
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:16,610
I want the work to be done perfectly,

38
00:01:16,630 --> 00:01:17,310
like,

39
00:01:17,430 --> 00:01:19,490
if the client is happy, so am I.

40
00:01:19,510 --> 00:01:21,610
But I want you to see
what happens in the story.

41
00:01:21,630 --> 00:01:23,950
Even though they argue this much,
how do they end up falling in love?

42
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:27,570
Maybe they find each other adorable,

43
00:01:27,590 --> 00:01:30,120
and that's how they start to
take an interest in each other.

44
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:31,540
This is just a brief overview,

45
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,710
but for how the story unfolds,

46
00:01:32,730 --> 00:01:34,460
you have to watch to see what happens.

47
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:35,330
Stay tuned.

48
00:01:35,450 --> 00:01:39,470
[What is your character like?]

49
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:42,170
Lada is a business girl,

50
00:01:42,190 --> 00:01:43,570
so she's confident.

51
00:01:43,590 --> 00:01:44,470
She graduated abroad,

52
00:01:44,490 --> 00:01:46,630
which is why she has
a lot of self-confidence. And...

53
00:01:46,650 --> 00:01:47,990
whatever she feels

54
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,610
or thinks, she often speaks her mind.

55
00:01:49,630 --> 00:01:51,300
She's quite straightforward.

56
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,470
She either loves someone to the moon

57
00:01:52,490 --> 00:01:53,700
or hates them to the core.

58
00:01:54,110 --> 00:01:56,080
For the characteristics of Mim,

59
00:01:56,110 --> 00:01:57,780
I must say that she's

60
00:01:57,800 --> 00:02:00,790
sweet, bright, and full of positive energy.

61
00:02:00,810 --> 00:02:02,230
And she's like

62
00:02:02,250 --> 00:02:03,980
the middle child

63
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:05,080
that has to...

64
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,280
Between the older and the younger,

65
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,690
I'm in the middle, right?

66
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:10,160
So I have to make these two

67
00:02:10,180 --> 00:02:11,880
get along well.

68
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:14,800
Xinxin is, like,
a Gen-Z feng shui master.

69
00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:15,950
The way she dressed

70
00:02:16,180 --> 00:02:17,650
is also fashionable,

71
00:02:17,670 --> 00:02:19,920
and she's a lively

72
00:02:20,060 --> 00:02:22,660
and quite confident person.

73
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:24,210
She lives with just her mother,

74
00:02:24,230 --> 00:02:25,890
and she wants to take care of her,

75
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,040
so that has made her a confident person.

76
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,550
For Soul,

77
00:02:29,570 --> 00:02:31,750
she's someone
who's serious about her work,

78
00:02:31,770 --> 00:02:33,890
about her life, and about everything.

79
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:36,620
She's also the head of her family

80
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,750
because...

81
00:02:37,770 --> 00:02:40,880
it's just her and her mother at home,

82
00:02:41,020 --> 00:02:43,620
and at work, Soul is also a manager.

83
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:47,230
So, when it comes to being serious,
she's a hundred out of ten.

84
00:02:47,310 --> 00:02:48,390
As for love,

85
00:02:48,410 --> 00:02:50,410
Soul has some issues
when it comes to relationships,

86
00:02:50,450 --> 00:02:52,890
so it's really hard for her

87
00:02:52,910 --> 00:02:54,270
to love someone.

88
00:02:54,290 --> 00:02:55,980
How does Soul

89
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:56,933
even fall for someone?

90
00:02:56,948 --> 00:02:58,480
And when she finally does,

91
00:02:59,290 --> 00:03:00,870
oh...she changes a lot.

92
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,840
You'll have to watch the series

93
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,220
to find out how soft it can be.

94
00:03:04,330 --> 00:03:08,010
[What is it about a character
that makes you want to play them?]

95
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,590
She's someone who,

96
00:03:09,730 --> 00:03:11,090
let's say, is really expressive.

97
00:03:11,110 --> 00:03:12,750
She's really emotional

98
00:03:12,770 --> 00:03:14,510
when she feels something, and

99
00:03:14,530 --> 00:03:16,710
it'll just show on her face,

100
00:03:16,730 --> 00:03:19,880
whether she's angry, mad, or happy.

101
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:21,860
She's kinda like a cartoon character.

102
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,990
For Soul,

103
00:03:24,020 --> 00:03:25,030
I think it's her seriousness.

104
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,780
Whether it's about

105
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,900
work or her personal life,

106
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:30,020
if someone wants to
entrust something to Soul,

107
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:31,390
they can trust her with it

108
00:03:31,410 --> 00:03:33,960
because she's someone who always

109
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:35,790
puts her whole heart

110
00:03:35,810 --> 00:03:38,140
into both work and love.

111
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:39,930
What makes people fall for her

112
00:03:39,950 --> 00:03:41,870
is her seriousness.

113
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:44,470
She's a really cheerful person.

114
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:46,730
Whenever she's around,

115
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:48,290
like when she comes into the office,

116
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:51,660
she's the kind of person
who brightens up the atmosphere

117
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:53,750
and makes everyone laugh.

118
00:03:53,770 --> 00:03:55,010
If you watch this series,

119
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:57,970
I guarantee you'll fall in love with Mim.

120
00:03:58,650 --> 00:04:00,880
She's someone who

121
00:04:01,010 --> 00:04:02,510
says and does whatever comes to mind.

122
00:04:02,530 --> 00:04:04,830
She won't hesitate or hold anything back.

123
00:04:04,850 --> 00:04:06,940
If she likes someone, then she likes them.

124
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:09,310
And if she wants to kiss someone,
she just kisses them.

125
00:04:09,850 --> 00:04:13,570
[How similar to or different from your character
do you think you are, and why?]

126
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,140
So similar.

127
00:04:15,290 --> 00:04:17,590
Because Mim

128
00:04:17,810 --> 00:04:19,900
has always been cute and cheerful.

129
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:22,190
Even though we're still slightly different,

130
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:23,620
we're pretty much the same.

131
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:26,670
For me, I think I'm more energetic.

132
00:04:26,690 --> 00:04:27,220
Yeah...

133
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,910
Like...when I'm in a scene,

134
00:04:28,930 --> 00:04:30,090
the director often says,

135
00:04:30,110 --> 00:04:32,070
like... "Can you tone it down a bit?

136
00:04:32,090 --> 00:04:33,210
This is too Jennie."

137
00:04:33,230 --> 00:04:35,770
If it's me, I'm always
super hyper and full of energy,

138
00:04:35,790 --> 00:04:37,200
but Mim is, like,

139
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:40,630
polite, sweet...

140
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,730
a smooth talker, a pro,

141
00:04:42,750 --> 00:04:44,180
smiley, and cheerful.

142
00:04:44,310 --> 00:04:46,020
Mim is sweeter,

143
00:04:46,140 --> 00:04:47,870
while I'm more energetic,

144
00:04:47,890 --> 00:04:48,990
but we're both pretty.

145
00:04:49,010 --> 00:04:49,570
Yeah.

146
00:04:49,590 --> 00:04:51,230
We're alike in...

147
00:04:51,340 --> 00:04:53,360
how serious we are about work.

148
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:56,450
For example, when I'm serious about work,

149
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,880
I'm quite strict.

150
00:04:57,900 --> 00:05:00,200
If I have a schedule,

151
00:05:00,330 --> 00:05:01,980
I'll stick to it.

152
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,530
If someone changes my plans

153
00:05:03,550 --> 00:05:04,950
for no good reason,

154
00:05:04,970 --> 00:05:05,740
I'll get annoyed.

155
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,680
In the series,
Soul gets even more annoyed

156
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:08,810
than I do.

157
00:05:08,930 --> 00:05:10,860
But I can relate to

158
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:12,770
how serious Soul is

159
00:05:12,790 --> 00:05:14,170
about work because

160
00:05:14,190 --> 00:05:16,140
I care about the details in my work as well.

161
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,790
The difference is that

162
00:05:17,820 --> 00:05:20,670
Soul is also serious outside of work.

163
00:05:20,690 --> 00:05:22,110
When talking to her mother,

164
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:25,130
coworkers after hours...

165
00:05:25,150 --> 00:05:26,460
or even Xinxin,

166
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,450
Soul is

167
00:05:27,470 --> 00:05:29,090
always so proper,

168
00:05:29,110 --> 00:05:31,500
like a school disciplinarian.

169
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:32,790
But I'm not like her.

170
00:05:32,810 --> 00:05:34,310
Personally, when I'm

171
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,910
off the clock,

172
00:05:35,990 --> 00:05:37,720
I'm pretty chill

173
00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:38,910
and chatty with others.

174
00:05:38,930 --> 00:05:40,190
So I feel like

175
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:43,430
I need to be a bit more composed

176
00:05:43,450 --> 00:05:44,730
when I'm not in my work role

177
00:05:44,750 --> 00:05:46,890
because Soul is much calmer than I am.

178
00:05:46,910 --> 00:05:48,840
When I played Soul,

179
00:05:48,860 --> 00:05:49,980
it made me feel a lot calmer,

180
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,680
as I wasn't acting so playful anymore.

181
00:05:51,960 --> 00:05:54,320
Well, quite similar...

182
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:56,000
I'm really similar to her,

183
00:05:56,210 --> 00:05:58,410
and it's not just me who thinks so.

184
00:05:58,430 --> 00:06:00,150
Others have said

185
00:06:00,170 --> 00:06:01,360
we're quite similar, too.

186
00:06:01,380 --> 00:06:02,590
I'm a lot like Lada

187
00:06:02,610 --> 00:06:05,410
because Lada is quite confident

188
00:06:05,490 --> 00:06:06,780
and has a Western way

189
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,230
of thinking and speaking.

190
00:06:08,250 --> 00:06:09,610
Because she...

191
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:11,680
studied and graduated abroad,

192
00:06:11,700 --> 00:06:13,140
and she's a business girl, right?

193
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:15,180
And I also have my own little business,

194
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:16,720
so that's why I think we're really similar.

195
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,390
Well, maybe everyone

196
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:19,680
thinks

197
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:21,860
she's similar to me. I'm not so sure,

198
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:24,370
but the big difference is that...

199
00:06:24,390 --> 00:06:25,890
I'm not into colors.
[She's not into colors!]

200
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:29,430
In real life, my wardrobe is black and white.

201
00:06:29,450 --> 00:06:30,620
I'm not into...

202
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:33,110
wearing colorful clothes.

203
00:06:33,130 --> 00:06:34,220
And secondly,

204
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:37,220
I'm not a sarcastic person in real life,

205
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,890
but Xinxin is.

206
00:06:38,910 --> 00:06:41,140
Whenever she's upset with Soul
or annoyed by anything,

207
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,740
she'll speak

208
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:46,380
sarcastically so the other person knows.

209
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:48,450
While I'm quite...

210
00:06:48,610 --> 00:06:49,620
calmer

211
00:06:50,230 --> 00:06:52,270
than Xinxin, too.

212
00:06:52,290 --> 00:06:54,900
Maybe I'm like this at work,

213
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:57,230
but in real life,

214
00:06:57,350 --> 00:06:59,400
I'm quite a quiet person.

215
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:01,250
None of these really match...

216
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:02,890
Wait, there's one.

217
00:07:03,010 --> 00:07:04,310
Because...

218
00:07:04,330 --> 00:07:06,900
My mother believes in

219
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:09,450
fortune-telling and feng shui,

220
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:12,210
and she taught me a little about them.

221
00:07:12,230 --> 00:07:14,230
Like, I know a little bit about feng shui

222
00:07:14,250 --> 00:07:15,900
and fortune-telling,

223
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,510
so I can do it a little.

224
00:07:17,744 --> 00:07:21,350
[Was there any preparation you had to do
for this role, and how much was it?]

225
00:07:21,530 --> 00:07:24,740
Actually, we prepared together

226
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:27,100
and did a lot of workshops.

227
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:29,020
For each character,

228
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:31,250
we researched their backgrounds.

229
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:33,430
If it were Lada or Mim,

230
00:07:33,450 --> 00:07:34,700
what kind of thoughts would they have,

231
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,010
and what would they like or dislike?

232
00:07:36,030 --> 00:07:38,770
We did around
two or three research sessions

233
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:40,130
on the characters' backgrounds.

234
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:43,620
I studied what I already knew

235
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,800
because it was quite easy for me,

236
00:07:45,950 --> 00:07:49,140
as it involved numerology

237
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,690
and feng shui directions.

238
00:07:50,710 --> 00:07:51,740
For this role,

239
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:54,150
I really worked hard because,

240
00:07:54,170 --> 00:07:54,860
first of all,

241
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:56,860
I hadn't starred in a drama for seven years.

242
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,220
Secondly,

243
00:07:58,330 --> 00:08:00,950
even though Soul and I

244
00:08:00,970 --> 00:08:02,630
are equally serious,

245
00:08:02,650 --> 00:08:04,670
we're different in our posture,

246
00:08:04,690 --> 00:08:05,890
the way we walk,

247
00:08:05,910 --> 00:08:06,730
and the way we sound.

248
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:08,000
So, during the workshops,

249
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:10,330
changing my personality
to become someone else

250
00:08:10,350 --> 00:08:11,893
was quite challenging for me.

251
00:08:11,918 --> 00:08:15,090
When filming began,
I thought I understood this character,

252
00:08:15,110 --> 00:08:16,170
but I still didn't.

253
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:18,340
So, I was secretly taking acting lessons

254
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:21,020
to work on my gestures and voice...

255
00:08:21,170 --> 00:08:22,970
and to understand the character better,

256
00:08:22,990 --> 00:08:24,830
because I have to become someone else.

257
00:08:24,970 --> 00:08:26,420
Going from Pimji

258
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,660
to Soul.

259
00:08:27,770 --> 00:08:30,610
But after those lessons,
after I got to understand Soul better,

260
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,880
I think this character is really charming.

261
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,650
Once I understood Soul,
everything fell into place...

262
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:37,170
Filming was really fun.

263
00:08:37,190 --> 00:08:39,240
Being Soul is, like...

264
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:41,590
fun, and I get to...

265
00:08:41,610 --> 00:08:43,630
grow along with the character.

266
00:08:43,910 --> 00:08:45,830
I think this is...

267
00:08:46,410 --> 00:08:47,410
the character I did the least research on.

268
00:08:47,430 --> 00:08:48,270
- Oh?
- What?

269
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:49,130
What was that?

270
00:08:49,180 --> 00:08:52,060
I think it's already natural,

271
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,710
and I feel like...

272
00:08:53,730 --> 00:08:55,730
I didn't have to change much

273
00:08:55,750 --> 00:08:57,510
to fit the character.

274
00:08:57,530 --> 00:08:59,530
When we did workshops,

275
00:08:59,550 --> 00:09:01,610
that's when I started to learn about

276
00:09:01,630 --> 00:09:04,330
Mim's thoughts,

277
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,720
her walking posture,

278
00:09:06,820 --> 00:09:08,250
what she wanted to eat,

279
00:09:08,270 --> 00:09:09,410
her thought process,

280
00:09:09,430 --> 00:09:11,990
