286
00:09:22,750 --> 00:09:23,950
It's more of an anecdote.

287
00:09:23,970 --> 00:09:27,750
We never actually kissed
during the workshop.

288
00:09:27,770 --> 00:09:30,190
We kissed for real on set

289
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:31,319
because we were wondering...

290
00:09:31,344 --> 00:09:34,020
