291
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:34,750
It was just a kiss.

292
00:09:34,770 --> 00:09:35,970
Then we tried kissing each other.

293
00:09:35,990 --> 00:09:37,140
But there were some struggles

294
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:39,130
because we hadn't done it before,

295
00:09:39,150 --> 00:09:41,190
so the timing was...a bit off.

296
00:09:41,210 --> 00:09:43,170
I was biting her lips harshly, too.

297
00:09:43,290 --> 00:09:46,530
Also, there were times
we went all out

298
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:49,100
way too early for the scene.

299
00:09:49,350 --> 00:09:51,020
We just kept going and going.

300
00:09:51,130 --> 00:09:51,650
Niink said,

301
00:09:51,670 --> 00:09:53,390
"Jennie, slow down. Calm down.

302
00:09:53,410 --> 00:09:55,000
Don't step on the gas pedal just yet."

303
00:09:55,020 --> 00:09:56,430
So we decided to...

304
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:58,860
practice on our own.

305
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,740
We practiced kissing behind closed doors,

306
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:02,560
something like that.

307
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,230
There was a scene that I thought...

308
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:07,520
For our pair, most of the scenes were

309
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:10,120
leaning towards...

310
00:10:10,310 --> 00:10:12,210
