311
00:10:12,230 --> 00:10:14,750
You'll have to find out what "intense"
means, though.

312
00:10:14,770 --> 00:10:16,350
However, there was a scene

313
00:10:16,370 --> 00:10:17,380
that I thought...

314
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,660
"Oh, a love scene? Okay.

315
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:19,940
Another one? Sure thing."

316
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:22,360
There was this particular scene where

317
00:10:22,380 --> 00:10:23,570
we had to kiss while walking.

318
00:10:25,690 --> 00:10:26,510
It was very tough.

319
00:10:26,530 --> 00:10:28,320
Like...we had to...

320
00:10:28,340 --> 00:10:29,900
We had to be in the moment, right?

321
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:31,990
But I was also worried I'd bump into things.

322
00:10:32,010 --> 00:10:33,690
The timing just wasn't right.

323
00:10:33,710 --> 00:10:34,690
We had to do several takes and...

324
00:10:34,710 --> 00:10:36,190
the director taught us techniques

325
00:10:36,210 --> 00:10:37,080
