326
00:10:37,100 --> 00:10:38,330
Then we discussed...

327
00:10:38,350 --> 00:10:39,650
what we should do.

328
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:41,860
The director gave us pieces of advice.

329
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:43,220
Because it was a scene that

330
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,810
