Pineare is like Shizuka.

555
00:18:23,690 --> 00:18:24,770
You feel me? She's like...

556
00:18:24,790 --> 00:18:26,130
She's really adorable.

557
00:18:26,150 --> 00:18:27,180
Yeah, she's got that

558
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,360
