604
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:50,490
Yes.

605
00:19:50,510 --> 00:19:51,580
I was like, wow...

606
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:52,820
Pete is Pimji's younger brother

607
00:19:52,840 --> 00:19:53,890
