610
00:19:56,790 --> 00:19:58,780
She looks so young and has a small frame.

611
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:00,530
So my first impression was,

612
00:20:00,550 --> 00:20:02,180
"She's so young."

613
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:03,290
But in the end, after some chats,

614
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:05,330
