639
00:20:47,610 --> 00:20:49,730
- See? I told you it was me.
- Yeah.

640
00:20:49,750 --> 00:20:50,420
Who am I talking to?

641
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,690
And after the audition

642
00:20:51,710 --> 00:20:53,170
