655
00:21:10,180 --> 00:21:12,120
I didn't even know the people there. I just went,

656
00:21:12,140 --> 00:21:14,480
"Excuse me, could I please go into that room?

657
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:15,880
I wanna play with the cats."

