00:38:42,930 --> 00:38:45,480
She heals her friends' hearts,

1211
00:38:45,650 --> 00:38:46,260
Mm.

1212
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:48,300
no matter what problems they face.

1213
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:50,260
I can relate to her quite a bit.

1214
00:38:50,280 --> 00:38:51,750
I'm basically this kind of person

1215
00:38:51,770 --> 00:38:53,200
