and finds ways or words to comfort them,

1217
00:38:57,230 --> 00:38:58,360
or makes a joke out of it.

1218
00:38:58,380 --> 00:39:00,340
But deep down, I care about them

1219
00:39:00,640 --> 00:39:01,360
and...

1220
00:39:01,870 --> 00:39:03,650
want to... comfort them,

1221
00:39:03,670 --> 00:39:04,880
