but have no partner of their own.

1235
00:39:25,190 --> 00:39:26,230
- Right.
- You get it?

1236
00:39:26,250 --> 00:39:27,760
Both in real life and in the series.

1237
00:39:27,780 --> 00:39:29,040
In the series, Nan is on the hunt.

1238
00:39:29,390 --> 00:39:30,910
- Hunt?
- There's a scene...

1239
00:39:31,980 --> 00:39:33,320
