1245
00:39:43,630 --> 00:39:45,220
Like when these three are together,

1246
00:39:45,240 --> 00:39:46,230
Xinxin's gang,

1247
00:39:46,250 --> 00:39:47,390
Xinxin, Lada, and Nan,

1248
00:39:47,410 --> 00:39:49,340
