1250
00:39:51,430 --> 00:39:53,900
Or for scenes where
Pineare and Pimji interact,

1251
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:54,610
Soul and Xinxin,

1252
00:39:54,630 --> 00:39:55,590
it's a different vibe

1253
00:39:55,610 --> 00:39:56,730
in each episode.

1254
00:39:56,750 --> 00:39:58,540
Like Pineare and Pimji in the early shoots,

1255
00:39:58,560 --> 00:40:00,100
they were different from later on...

1256
00:40:00,120 --> 00:40:02,250
Once they started clicking...

1257
00:40:02,270 --> 00:40:03,920
things got easier, and...

1258
00:40:04,120 --> 00:40:06,980
The crew once talked about
a scene with those two.

1259
00:40:07,190 --> 00:40:09,350
Like, with some scenes,

1260
00:40:09,370 --> 00:40:11,400
