1267
00:40:21,850 --> 00:40:23,080
Then suddenly, we saw it.

1268
00:40:23,100 --> 00:40:24,110
Like...

1269
00:40:24,130 --> 00:40:25,630
It just appeared out of nowhere.

1270
00:40:25,650 --> 00:40:27,410
That happens a lot with the main couple.

1271
00:40:27,730 --> 00:40:29,020
As for the secondary couple...

1272
00:40:29,040 --> 00:40:29,450
like I said,

1273
00:40:29,470 --> 00:40:31,650
the NC scenes will be pretty intense.

1274
00:40:31,670 --> 00:40:33,770
I could see the effort
everyone put in, because...

1275
00:40:33,790 --> 00:40:35,970
I was very careful during the briefing.

1276
00:40:35,990 --> 00:40:37,310
Once the briefing was over,

1277
00:40:37,330 --> 00:40:38,830
