1281
00:40:44,030 --> 00:40:45,210
The filming process...

1282
00:40:45,230 --> 00:40:46,310
well, it has to feel safe,

1283
00:40:46,330 --> 00:40:47,950
which makes things more difficult.

1284
00:40:47,970 --> 00:40:48,870
Once we call "Cut,"

1285
00:40:48,890 --> 00:40:50,410
it takes a while before the crew can get in.

1286
00:40:50,430 --> 00:40:52,430
We make sure the actors are safe first.

1287
00:40:52,610 --> 00:40:54,190
We have to look out for each other,

1288
00:40:54,210 --> 00:40:56,270
so it takes quite a bit of time.

1289
00:40:56,290 --> 00:40:57,370
I hope you check it out.

1290
00:40:57,390 --> 00:40:58,680
The office gang is fun, too.

1291
00:40:58,850 --> 00:41:00,420
Mim, Oyl, and Soul.

1292
00:41:00,440 --> 00:41:02,120
They have a whole different dynamic.

1293
00:41:02,240 --> 00:41:03,490
- Because office... yeah.
- Because they fight?

1294
00:41:03,510 --> 00:41:04,930
Because Soul is so scary.

1295
00:41:05,780 --> 00:41:06,740
Mim would cower in fear.

1296
00:41:06,760 --> 00:41:08,220
- Each character is so distinct.
- Yes.

1297
00:41:08,240 --> 00:41:09,770
- Mm.
- It's a...a different vibe.

1298
00:41:09,960 --> 00:41:10,890
Or with the moms,

1299
00:41:10,910 --> 00:41:12,430
Kik and Lookwa,

1300
00:41:12,610 --> 00:41:13,450
