1301
00:41:13,470 --> 00:41:14,270
They are so nice...

1302
00:41:14,290 --> 00:41:15,540
Kik is super nice.

1303
00:41:15,560 --> 00:41:19,350
She's a senior actress
I'd never worked with before,

1304
00:41:19,370 --> 00:41:21,140
though I'd seen her

1305
00:41:21,160 --> 00:41:22,410
in her previous work.

1306
00:41:22,930 --> 00:41:24,850
She's so lovely and so gentle.

1307
00:41:24,870 --> 00:41:26,370
She helped us a lot.

1308
00:41:26,390 --> 00:41:28,690
Some days, things on set were really rushed,

1309
00:41:28,710 --> 00:41:29,450
because we had

1310
00:41:29,750 --> 00:41:31,590
