00:42:38,310 --> 00:42:41,820
For those who've known us
from our BL projects,

1347
00:42:42,160 --> 00:42:43,650
I'd like you to open your heart

1348
00:42:43,670 --> 00:42:46,690
and give my first GL project a try.

1349
00:42:47,170 --> 00:42:48,990
Honestly, ever since I first read the novel,

1350
00:42:49,010 --> 00:42:51,380
I've been part of this process
for two or three years.

1351
00:42:51,400 --> 00:42:53,870
It took all that time to
finally come to life on screen.

1352
00:42:53,890 --> 00:42:55,260
It's been almost four years.

1353
00:42:55,280 --> 00:42:56,530
So I want everyone to see...

1354
00:42:56,550 --> 00:42:57,940
how much heart we've put into it,

1355
00:42:57,960 --> 00:43:00,440
because we gave it our all
at every step of the process,

1356
00:43:00,590 --> 00:43:02,980
as this is the company's first GL project,

1357
00:43:03,000 --> 00:43:03,860
the crew's first,

1358
00:43:03,880 --> 00:43:06,670
and all the actors' first as well.

1359
00:43:06,690 --> 00:43:08,660
Everything about it has been so lovely.

1360
00:43:08,680 --> 00:43:10,180
For me, it's a project

1361
00:43:10,200 --> 00:43:11,790
we've given absolutely everything to.

1362
00:43:11,810 --> 00:43:13,390
We all worked really hard.

1363
00:43:13,800 --> 00:43:14,780
So please support us.

1364
00:43:14,800 --> 00:43:16,740
'Built in Love' on GMM25

1365
00:43:16,760 --> 00:43:17,570
at 8:30 P.M.

1366
00:43:17,590 --> 00:43:19,470
It's a year-end romcom.

1367
00:43:19,490 --> 00:43:20,140
So it's...

1368
00:43:20,160 --> 00:43:22,190
lighthearted, and you don't have to
think too hard.

1369
00:43:22,210 --> 00:43:24,210
It's hilarious and full of flavor.

1370
00:43:24,770 --> 00:43:25,950
And don't be so humble.

1371
00:43:25,970 --> 00:43:27,400
That's your specialty.

1372
00:43:27,530 --> 00:43:28,480
- Come on...
- Please check it out.

1373
00:43:28,860 --> 00:43:30,000
We welcome your feedback.

1374
00:43:30,020 --> 00:43:31,150
Thank you.

1375
00:43:31,170 --> 00:43:32,780
Please check it out.

1376
00:43:33,640 --> 00:43:34,520
Bye-bye.

1377
00:43:37,800 --> 00:43:39,280
The weather is so nice.

1378
00:43:39,760 --> 00:43:41,320
Today is going to be a good day.

1379
00:43:42,780 --> 00:43:43,720
Oh no!

1380
00:43:43,790 --> 00:43:44,680
What do you mean?

1381
00:43:44,890 --> 00:43:47,560
I stepped out with my right foot first.

1382
00:43:49,560 --> 00:43:51,600
This area should be adjusted.

1383
00:43:51,730 --> 00:43:52,820
Not a chance!

1384
00:43:56,740 --> 00:43:57,960
Here comes bad luck...

1385
00:43:59,080 --> 00:44:02,080
[One believes in Feng Shui,
the other believes in structure]

1386
00:44:02,100 --> 00:44:04,980
If this house doesn't align with
Feng Shui principles,

1387
00:44:05,000 --> 00:44:06,880
I wouldn't feel comfortable living here.

1388
00:44:07,090 --> 00:44:07,880
Tear it down.

1389
00:44:08,180 --> 00:44:09,080
Tear it down.

1390
00:44:09,170 --> 00:44:09,800
Tear it down.

1391
00:44:09,900 --> 00:44:10,240
Tear.

1392
00:44:10,360 --> 00:44:10,680
It!

1393
00:44:10,790 --> 00:44:11,400
Down!!

1394
00:44:11,420 --> 00:44:13,640
But it has nothing to do with Feng Shui.

1395
00:44:13,710 --> 00:44:15,080
Of course it does.

1396
00:44:15,940 --> 00:44:17,180
Will you work with me?

1397
00:44:17,660 --> 00:44:18,950
I don't like you.

1398
00:44:18,970 --> 00:44:20,120
You don't like me either.

1399
00:44:20,410 --> 00:44:22,880
It's a win-win for both of us, alright?

1400
00:44:23,030 --> 00:44:23,880
Deal.

1401
00:44:23,980 --> 00:44:25,400
I'll work with you,

1402
00:44:25,540 --> 00:44:27,200
so we won't have to see each other again.

1403
00:44:29,520 --> 00:44:32,520
[When building a house requires
both reason and belief]

1404
00:44:37,400 --> 00:44:39,240
I consulted Master Xinxin

1405
00:44:39,260 --> 00:44:40,360
about Feng Shui.

1406
00:44:40,530 --> 00:44:43,120
Has the architect opened her heart
to the Feng Shui master?

1407
00:44:43,220 --> 00:44:45,070
Ohh...

1408
00:44:46,290 --> 00:44:48,440
If you want things to go smoothly,

1409
00:44:48,720 --> 00:44:51,090
try wearing the day's auspicious color too.

1410
00:44:51,200 --> 00:44:53,640
Or you could just put a lamp on your desk.

1411
00:44:53,740 --> 00:44:55,960
It'll help you find love.

1412
00:45:01,120 --> 00:45:02,360
Do you guarantee it?

1413
00:45:02,740 --> 00:45:05,000
I swear on my honor as a Feng Shui master.

1414
00:45:07,120 --> 00:45:10,090
An architect and a Feng Shui master
are a showdown waiting to happen.

1415
00:45:10,400 --> 00:45:12,820
If I were a spectator,

1416
00:45:13,150 --> 00:45:14,540
I'd root for this pair.

1417
00:45:14,560 --> 00:45:15,810
Mom!

1418
00:45:16,440 --> 00:45:18,800
What will my relationship with her be like?

1419
00:45:19,940 --> 00:45:22,040
[THE LOVERS]

1420
00:45:24,720 --> 00:45:26,440
Is there an emergency?

1421
00:45:27,240 --> 00:45:28,040
There is.

1422
00:45:28,280 --> 00:45:29,480
I wanted to see you.

1423
00:45:29,530 --> 00:45:31,300
That's not an emergency.

1424
00:45:32,220 --> 00:45:33,920
You are the first person

1425
00:45:33,940 --> 00:45:35,830
I've ever brought to my place...

1426
00:45:42,550 --> 00:45:44,110
Lioness...

1427
00:45:44,500 --> 00:45:46,240
You said you don't like her,

1428
00:45:46,520 --> 00:45:48,240
but you do care about her a lot.

1429
00:45:48,480 --> 00:45:51,420
You even coined a word just for her.

1430
00:45:51,440 --> 00:45:54,400
Lately, Xinxin seems much happier.

1431
00:45:55,270 --> 00:45:56,920
When will you stop running away?

1432
00:45:57,100 --> 00:45:58,260
I'm not running away.

1433
00:45:58,280 --> 00:46:00,960
Stop acting like a spoiled brat.

1434
00:46:01,360 --> 00:46:04,080
Do you think everyone has to
chase after you all the time?

1435
00:46:07,990 --> 00:46:09,080
Well...

1436
00:46:09,460 --> 00:46:11,580
you're not the only architect in the world.

1437
00:46:12,910 --> 00:46:15,360
But the only Feng Shui master
I want to work with...

1438
00:46:15,960 --> 00:46:17,040
is you.

1439
00:46:17,870 --> 00:46:19,680
This is straight-up flirting.

1440
00:46:20,490 --> 00:46:21,750
Well, can I?

1441
00:46:24,240 --> 00:46:30,920
[Built in Love]

1442
00:46:31,740 --> 00:46:33,280
Try feeling your heart,

1443
00:46:33,300 --> 00:46:34,210
like this.

1444
00:46:37,390 --> 00:46:39,240
If you like someone,

1445
00:46:39,950 --> 00:46:41,560
when you're close to them,

1446
00:46:42,830 --> 00:46:44,580
your heart will beat faster.

1447
00:46:50,520 --> 00:46:54,120
[Every Wednesday at 8:30 P.M. on GMM25]

1448
00:46:54,140 --> 00:46:57,740
[Watch the Uncut version at 9:30 P.M.,
exclusively on WeTV]

1449
00:46:57,760 --> 00:47:01,220
[Premieres October 21]
